Gate computation:

```java
/**
 * 外部机构门禁快照：gated 表示 HIGH 任务当前不可完成；
 * pending 为尚无回执的必需机构，rejected 为已拒绝机构（均已排序）。
 */
private record AgencyGate(boolean gated, String reason, List<String> pending,
                          List<String> rejected) {
}

private AgencyGate agencyGate(Incident incident) {
    var configOpt = agencies.findActiveConfig(incident.id());
    if (configOpt.isEmpty()) {
        return new AgencyGate(false, null, List.of(), List.of());
    }
    AgencyConfig config = configOpt.get();
    List<AgencyReceipt> receipts = agencies.listReceipts(incident.id(), config.version());
    Set<String> confirmed = receipts.stream()
            .filter(r -> r.type() == AgencyReceiptType.CONFIRM)
            .map(AgencyReceipt::agencyCode).collect(toCollection(TreeSet::new));
    List<String> rejected = receipts.stream()
            .filter(r -> r.type() == AgencyReceiptType.REJECT)
            .map(AgencyReceipt::agencyCode).sorted().toList();
    List<String> pending = config.agencyCodes().stream()
            .filter(c -> !confirmed.contains(c))
            .filter(c -> !rejected.contains(c))
            .toList();
    if (incident.status() == IncidentStatus.EXTERNAL_BLOCKED) {
        return new AgencyGate(true, "EXTERNAL_BLOCKED", pending, rejected);
    }
    if (!pending.isEmpty() || !rejected.isEmpty()) {
        return new AgencyGate(true, "AGENCY_ACK_PENDING", pending, rejected);
    }
    return new AgencyGate(false, null, List.of(), List.of());
}
```

Wait — if rejected non-empty but incident not EXTERNAL_BLOCKED? Reject always triggers EXTERNAL_BLOCKED in same tx. Except: reject on old version, then config replaced → new version has no receipts; old rejected receipts belong to old version (we query only current version). So rejected non-empty implies EXTERNAL_BLOCKED in practice. But defensive: if rejected non-empty → gated with reason EXTERNAL_BLOCKED? Since we only look at current version receipts, a reject in current version implies incident is EXTERNAL_BLOCKED. Keep both conditions: EXTERNAL_BLOCKED status → reason EXTERNAL_BLOCKED; else pending/rejected non-empty → AGENCY_ACK_PENDING. Actually if rejected non-empty, unconfirmed non-empty → gated regardless. Good.

Unconfirmed list for 422 details: pending + rejected sorted. Spec says "列出未确认机构" — unconfirmed = required agencies without CONFIRM. I'll provide details as sorted list of pending+rejected.

