```java
@Transactional
public AgencyReceiptView submitAgencyAck(String incidentKey, AgencyAckRequest req) {
    String ackKey = requireText(req.ackKey(), "ackKey");
    String agencyCode = requireText(req.agencyCode(), "agencyCode");
    String typeText = requireText(req.type(), "type");
    if (req.configVersion() == null) {
        throw ApiException.badRequest("configVersion 不能为空");
    }
    long configVersion = req.configVersion();
    AgencyReceiptType type;
    try {
        type = AgencyReceiptType.valueOf(typeText);
    } catch (IllegalArgumentException e) {
        throw ApiException.badRequest("type 必须为 CONFIRM 或 REJECT");
    }
    String reason = req.reason() == null ? null : req.reason().strip();
    if (type == AgencyReceiptType.REJECT && (reason == null || reason.isEmpty())) {
        throw ApiException.badRequest("拒绝回执必须携带非空说明 reason");
    }
    if (type == AgencyReceiptType.CONFIRM && reason != null && reason.isEmpty()) {
        reason = null;
    }
    String reasonHash = reason == null ? "" : reason;
    Incident incident = lockIncident(incidentKey);
    String finalReason = reason;
    return runIdempotent(ackKey, "agency_ack",
            hash(incidentKey, agencyCode, String.valueOf(configVersion), type.name(), reasonHash),
            AgencyReceiptView.class, () -> {
                if (incident.status() == IncidentStatus.CLOSED) {
                    throw ApiException.conflict("事件已关闭，不能提交外部机构回执");
                }
                AgencyConfig config = agencies.findActiveConfig(incident.id())
                        .orElseThrow(() -> ApiException.conflict("事件尚未配置必需外部机构"));
                if (config.version() != configVersion) {
                    throw ApiException.conflict("配置版本已过期: 回执版本 " + configVersion
                            + "，当前版本 " + config.version());
                }
                if (!config.agencyCodes().contains(agencyCode)) {
                    throw ApiException.conflict("机构不在当前版本必需列表: " + agencyCode);
                }
                if (agencies.findReceipt(incident.id(), config.version(), agencyCode).isPresent()) {
                    throw ApiException.conflict("机构在当前配置版本已有终态回执: " + agencyCode);
                }
                Instant now = now();
                long receiptId = agencies.insertReceipt(new AgencyReceipt(0L, incident.id(),
                        config.version(), agencyCode, type, finalReason, ackKey, now));
                if (type == AgencyReceiptType.REJECT
                        && incident.status() != IncidentStatus.EXTERNAL_BLOCKED) {
                    incidents.markExternalBlocked(incident.id(), incident.status(), now);
                    incidents.insertStatusChange(new StatusChange(0L, incident.id(),
                            incident.status(), IncidentStatus.EXTERNAL_BLOCKED, agencyCode, now));
                }
                return toReceiptView(agencies.findReceipt(...).orElseThrow());
            });
}
```

Hmm — receipt insert can hit DuplicateKeyException on concurrent same agency+version (different ackKeys). The incident row lock serializes, so findReceipt check suffices within the lock. But lock ordering: both transactions lock the incident row first → serialized. OK. But to be safe, catch DuplicateKeyException → conflict. Let me wrap insertReceipt in try/catch DuplicateKeyException → conflict "已有终态回执". Good defensive.

Note runIdempotent placeholder insert happens before business; failure rolls back → "失败不占键". 

Also: should receipt submission be allowed when incident REPORTED? Config can't exist then (commander required to configure... wait, requireCommander on REPORTED incident: commander is null → conflict). So no config → conflict "尚未配置". Fine.

